            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "These are snapshots of the NeuroVault.org database. They include all public collections of statistical maps deposited in NeuroVault as long as they were linked to an external publication.\r\n\r\nThis snapshot is an attempt to improve the chances of long term persistence of data deposited in NeuroVault.org.",
